ors. ; A type of word embedding used in the study.\n', 'Name:WORD2VEC\nDescription:A word embedding model typically learned from large-scale text corpora by modeling textual co-occurrences. ; A method used for learning word embeddings, which is central to the discussion of vis-w2v and its relationship to GloVe.\n', 'Name:WORDNET\nDescription:A lexical database used to augment ImageNet annotations with hypernyms. ; Used to compute Object-Hypernym (oh) counts and for identifying ancestors of ImageNet synsets. ; A lexical database used in the training of ViCo, providing hierarchical relationships between words.\n']split_entities: text_tokens=2647, instructions_tokens=500, budget_for_entities=6853, number_of_entities=121, avg_entity_tokens=35, max_entities=195, num_groups=1, entities_per_group=[121]
